    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Providing technical support to Presidential council on the national reconciliation process. 
2. Support Libyan Presidential Council in establishing an online platform for the NR process.
3. Develop and deliver a tailored training programme to build the capacities of members of the Network of local mediators.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. In coordination with UNSMIL and African Union, the project continued in providing the technical support to the NR process led by the Libyan Presidential council and the knowledge transfer on the ongoing peace agreements. Also, the project continued in supporting the legal committee that was created by the LPC. Furthermore, the project participated in the evaluation process of the projects proposals that was received from the national partners.
2. 0
3. In partnership with UNITAR, the project conducted successfully a well tailored training program for the network of local mediators. The training was designed in two components: Virtual training &amp; in person training. The training program was mainly on conflict analysis, writing proposals, and gender mainstream.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
